{"id":54336,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54336"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:23:11","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:23:11","slug":"trail-do-trabulo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-trabulo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Trabulo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Trabulo 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Trabulo 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Praia Fluvial do Trabulo<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>S\u00e1t\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>). O evento re\u00fane at\u00e9 1300 participantes distribu\u00eddos por tr\u00eas percursos circulares, com arrancadas faseadas \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> para o Trail de 25 km, \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> para o Mini-Trail de 15 km e \u00e0s <strong>09:35<\/strong> para a Caminhada de 11 km.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os trilhos cruzam as margens do <strong>rio Vouga<\/strong> por pontes de pedra e poldras seculares, atravessando as freguesias de Rom\u00e3s, Decermilo, Vila Longa, Ferreira de Aves, Mioma e Avelal. Ao longo do percurso de <strong>25 km<\/strong> (<strong>675m D+<\/strong>) e do <strong>Mini-Trail de 15 km<\/strong> (<strong>400m D+<\/strong>), passas pelos Santu\u00e1rios do Nosso Senhor dos Caminhos e do Senhor da Agonia, pela ponte pedonal da Quinta do Torges, pelo Convento de Santa Euf\u00eamia e pela exigente subida de 20% at\u00e9 \u00e0 Capela de S\u00e3o Matias da Serra, com vista panor\u00e2mica sobre o vale de Ferreira de Aves.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Sob a responsabilidade organizativa do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e1t\u00e3o<\/strong>, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado com chip, t-shirt oficial do evento em todas as dist\u00e2ncias, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, medalha <em>finisher<\/em> nas provas competitivas, massagem, duche e refei\u00e7\u00e3o conv\u00edvio na chegada. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0