le=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (20\/07 a 15\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/10 a 01\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 11 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35 \u2022 250m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do Trail do Trabulo 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail do Trabulo 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026 (domingo) na Praia Fluvial do Trabulo, em S\u00e1t\u00e3o. O Trail de 25 km parte \u00e0s 09:00, o Mini-Trail de 15 km \u00e0s 09:30 e a Caminhada de 11 km \u00e0s 09:35.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o Trail de 25 km (675m D+, limite de 5h00), o Mini-Trail de 15 km (400m D+, limite de 4h30) e a Caminhada de 11 km (250m D+, limite de 4h15), encerrando todas as provas \u00e0s 14:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail do Trabulo 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 1 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases: na 1\u00aa fase (20\/07 a 15\/10) custam 13 \u20ac no Trail 25 km, 10 \u20ac no Mini-Trail 15 km e 8 \u20ac na Caminhada; na 2\u00aa fase (16\/10 a 01\/11) custam 15 \u20ac no Trail 25 km, 12 \u20ac no Mini-Trail 15 km e 8 \u20ac na Caminhada.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido nas provas de Trail e Mini-Trail?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas do Trail (25 km) e Mini-Trail (15 km) devem transportar obrigatoriamente dorsal vis\u00edvel, dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua m\u00ednimo de 0,5 litro, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional e apito. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado (21 de novembro, das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00, em S\u00e1t\u00e3o) e no domingo (22 de novembro, a partir das 07:00, na Praia Fluvial do Trabulo). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt oficial, dorsal com chip, abastecimentos, medalha finisher (no Trail e Mini-Trail), duche, massagem e refei\u00e7\u00e3o de chegada.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Trabulo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sat\u00e3o, Viseu\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sat\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail do Trabulo 2026 realiza-se a 22 de novembro na Praia Fluvial do Trabulo, em S\u00e1t\u00e3o (Viseu). Provas de 25 km, 15 km e caminhada de 11 km. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-do-trabulo.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 25 km\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-do-trabulo-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini-Trail 15 km\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-do-trabulo-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 11 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-do-trabulo-2026\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do Trail do Trabulo 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail do Trabulo 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026